// #64: both sides close at once: the peer's FIN comes before the ACK of ours,
// so CLOSING, then TIME_WAIT on that ACK (RFC 9293 §3.10.7.4).
0      connect 192.0.2.2:80
+0     > S 0:0(0) <mss 1460,sackOK,nop,nop,TS val ? ecr 0,nop,wscale 8,eol>
+0.01  < S. 0:0(0) ack 1 win 4000 <mss 1460>
+0     > . 1:1(0) ack 1 win 65535

+0     close
+0     > F. 1:1(0) ack 1 win 65535
+0.01  < F. 1:1(0) ack 1 win 4000
+0     > . 2:2(0) ack 2 win 65535
+0     state CLOSING
+0.01  < . 2:2(0) ack 2 win 4000
+0     state TIME_WAIT
